sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant UI as Overview UI
    participant B as Backend

    U->>UI: click "Inspect"
    UI->>B: POST /api/articles/{id}/inspect
    B->>B: gate = 'pending'; append TimelineEvent
    B-->>UI: 202 { jobId, status: "running" }

    loop every 2 s (max 60 s)
        UI->>B: GET /api/jobs/{jobId}
        B-->>UI: { status: "running" }
    end

    Note over B: inspection completes
    B->>B: gate = pass | warn | fail; append TimelineEvent
    UI->>B: GET /api/jobs/{jobId}
    B-->>UI: { status: "done", result }
    UI->>B: GET /api/articles?page=…
    B-->>UI: updated article list with new gate badge